  "description": "Enchanting cottagecore woodland pattern featuring illustrated forest animals nestled among lush botanical foliage on a warm cream background.\nThis beautifully crafted surface pattern showcases a rabbit, hedgehog, and deer rendered in soft naturalistic illustration style, surrounded by scrolling acanthus-like foliage, detailed fern fronds, oak leaves, delicate peach bell-shaped flowers, and clusters of small coral-red berries. The overall composition draws from William Morris-inspired botanical damask traditions, updated with a gentle, modern storybook sensibility that feels both timeless and fresh.\nThe colour palette is deliberately muted and harmonious: warm ivory and antique cream form the background, while the foliage is rendered in dusty sage and muted olive greens. Animal figures are illustrated in soft tawny beige and warm tan tones, and the floral accents appear in blush peach and dusty coral-red, creating a palette that reads as naturally vintage and sophisticated. The mood is serene, nostalgic, and whimsical — evoking quiet forest mornings and slow countryside living.\nPerfect for sublimation printing, fabric design, gift wrap, nursery wallpaper, scrapbooking papers, stationery, tote bags, cushion covers, Canva templates, Procreate brushes, and Photoshop mockups. Ideal for baby shower themes, woodland nursery decor, nature-inspired apparel, and cottagecore lifestyle branding.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Enchanting cottagecore woodland pattern featuring illustrated forest animals nestled among lush botanical foliage on a warm cream background.</p>\n<p>This beautifully crafted surface pattern showcases a rabbit, hedgehog, and deer rendered in soft naturalistic illustration style, surrounded by scrolling acanthus-like foliage, detailed fern fronds, oak leaves, delicate peach bell-shaped flowers, and clusters of small coral-red berries. The overall composition draws from William Morris-inspired botanical damask traditions, updated with a gentle, modern storybook sensibility that feels both timeless and fresh.</p>\n<p>The colour palette is deliberately muted and harmonious: warm ivory and antique cream form the background, while the foliage is rendered in dusty sage and muted olive greens. Animal figures are illustrated in soft tawny beige and warm tan tones, and the floral accents appear in blush peach and dusty coral-red, creating a palette that reads as naturally vintage and sophisticated. The mood is serene, nostalgic, and whimsical — evoking quiet forest mornings and slow countryside living.</p>\n<p>Perfect for sublimation printing, fabric design, gift wrap, nursery wallpaper, scrapbooking papers, stationery, tote bags, cushion covers, Canva templates, Procreate brushes, and Photoshop mockups. Ideal for baby shower themes, woodland nursery decor, nature-inspired apparel, and cottagecore lifestyle branding.</p>",
